  "text": "Your outfit is built around a deep, moody palette of chocolate brown and charcoal grey, anchored by a soft merino cardigan with a rich burgundy heel that adds warmth to the autumn evening. The asymmetrical grey skirt introduces an architectural line, while the denim jacket offers a casual layer you can slip off if the sea breeze picks up. This combination feels effortlessly chic for your holiday itinerary, perfect for transitioning from a beach walk to a dinner by the shore.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Wear the cardigan over the dark tank top to create a seamless monochrome look that elongates your silhouette before adding the denim jacket at night if the evening gets cooler.",
    "Tuck the front of the grey skirt slightly into the waistband of your black trousers (if you are wearing them) or let it fall freely to highlight the asymmetrical hemline against your legs."
  ],
