    {
      "n": "#213·12",
      "text": "The dark green ribbed tank top features a soft, relaxed fit that drapes comfortably over your frame, providing a sleek base layer for the rest of your outfit."
    },
    {
      "n": "#521·01",
      "text": "This denim jacket with its white drawstrings and hood adds a casual yet structured element to your look, perfect for layering over the tank top when the evening air turns cooler."
    },
    {
      "n": "#87·01",
      "text": "The long grey skirt is defined by its elegant asymmetrical hemline that sweeps down one side, adding movement and a sophisticated architectural touch to your ensemble."
    },
    {
      "n": "#490·30",
      "text": "This chocolate brown cardigan features a soft merino alpaca blend with a hooded design and button closure, offering warmth and comfort while maintaining a refined texture against your skin."
    },
    {
      "n": "#456·10",
      "text": "The burgundy suede loafers have a low heel and a classic moccasin silhouette with a decorative strap, providing both style and stability for your time on the beach and dinner."
    },
    {
      "n": "#421·06",
      "text": "This red shoulder bag features a structured flap design and a braided gold-and-red chain strap, adding a vibrant pop of color and essential utility to your holiday travel."
